OL,3,GNEWSAPolice to issue interview letters
OL,4,Aas part of Garvaghy Road investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnionist politicians have called for
OL,7,Fthe police to take action against First
OL,8,FMinister Michelle O'Neill and other
OL,9,Fsenior Sinn Fein politicians who took
OL,10,Fpart in the protest against the Orange
OL,11,FOrder march.
OL,13,FA Sinn Fein spokesperson said they were
OL,14,Faware of the statement and would not be
OL,15,Fmaking any further comment due to the
OL,16,Fongoing investigation.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
